  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Project support to UNDP for the Energy Vulnerability Fund in Moldova</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Projektst&#xF6;d UNDP f&#xF6;r st&#xF6;d till Energifonden f&#xF6;r s&#xE5;rbara hush&#xE5;ll i Moldavien</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Fondens &#xE4;ndam&#xE5;l &#xE4;r att hj&#xE4;lpa Moldavien att hantera den kommande vinterns f&#xF6;rv&#xE4;ntade ekonomiska utmaningar p&#xE5; grund av kostsam och os&#xE4;ker energitillg&#xE5;ng genom att minska energikostnaderna f&#xF6;r s&#xE5;rbara hush&#xE5;ll.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The objective of the fund is to help Moldova deal with the expected economic challenges of the coming winter due to costly and uncertain energy supply by reducing energy costs for vulnerable households.</narrative>
  </description>
